# pdfcube
===
 PDFCube is a PDF presentation viewer with animated transitions, automatic slide timing, and keyboard-controlled zoom. It brings cube rotations, page flips, shattering glass, and smooth fades to slide decks from LaTeX Beamer and office suites.
